      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    }
  ],
  "confidence": "high",
  "decision_summary": "The query is donepezil, a known CNS-active drug. Direct detection of its N-oxide metabolite in rat brain and multiple close analogues with the same dimethoxy-indanone/N-benzylpiperidine scaffold showing high brain uptake and favorable brain/plasma ratios support meaningful CNS access.",
